            </div>
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">7-Day Royal Cultural Journey</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-gold-400 mt-0.5">Delhi • Agra • Jaipur • Private Chauffeur & Haveli Stays</p>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-navy-950/70 border border-slate-800 text-xs">
