              </div>

              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-navy-950/70 border border-slate-800 text-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold mb-1">
                  <span>Day 3 — Agra</span>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">High-Speed Gatimaan</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">Executive rail transit, Taj Mahal twilight viewing from Mehtab Bagh gardens.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-navy-950/70 border border-slate-800 text-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold mb-1">
